 pipes with or without screens;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"65d38eb2-5634-5813-ab6b-bda6cdfb2377"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.160.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","content_hash":"8a115b9cf907edfc86fb6c539337a50e65a163e22e80f1485c4ed95981112612","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","text":"(2) Tobacco rolling papers;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"28f1c119-8e32-5f73-a266-81fc989333e0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.160.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","content_hash":"a180e7386bb0e5ba57e1204af15d2eca5591a9907e49f6b4a5daf324e73a12dd","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","text":"(3) Tobacco/cigarette rollers; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"d211df8e-0890-5a60-8012-7b93d206e6b5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.160.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","content_hash":"2cf472e0d9a4a1751556b1a10afd00e9e2fa8715be8270a24657bba09881903f","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.160.010:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.160.010","text":"(4) Tobacco wraps/blunt wraps (flavored or unflavored). (Ord. 18676 § 2, 7-18-06. Code 1995 § 30-501.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_comp